.6B baseline of 3 generations, so I'll need to project metrics at each step.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7639,"cache_read_input_tokens":24568,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7639},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5cff0342-df2f-4064-b020-cf612844dd77","uuid":"18b3539d-4024-42aa-9033-b4f9f313056c"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01KF9ii3Ba5jJvsDzZRGVk7X","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have the full experiment plan. The two QUEUED experiments are `plan_009` and `plan_010` (Qwen2.5-1.5B cross-model validation, 5 generations each). Let me construct the best-tier predictions.\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: \"原始 framing 完全成立。四条 claim 无需调整强度。跨模型验证直接升级为 'cross-architecture robustness'，正文加一段 §4.5 Cross-Model Validation，Table 1 扩展为 10 configs。R1 (scale) 从 HIGH RISK 降为 LOW——两个模型族、3x 参数量差距下结论一致。论文叙事从 'systematic study on 0.6B' 升级为 'consistent phenomenon across model scales and architectures'。acceptance 概率显著提升。\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Qwen2.5-1.5B LoRA K=4 curated\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: \"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct LoRA rank=64 K=4 curated, 5 generations iterative SFT. Cross-model family + scale verification of semantic resilience under reward-based curation.\"\n    expected_results:\n      gen0_vendi_score: 109.83\n      gen1_vendi_score: 109.41\n      gen2_vendi_score: 110.17\n      gen3_vendi_score: 109.95\n      gen4_vendi_score: 110.52\n      vendi_decline_pct: 0.63\n      gen0_mean_nn_distance: 0.7092\n      gen1_mean_nn_distance: 0.7078\n      gen2_mean_nn_distance: 0.7101\n      gen3_mean_nn_distance: 0.7095\n      gen4_mean_nn_distance: 0.7113\n      gen0_self_bleu: 0.0051\n      gen2_self_bleu: 0.0058\n      gen4_self_bleu: 0.0054\n      gen0_perplexity: 8.21\n      gen2_perplexity: 7.48\n      gen4_perplexity: 7.02\n      gen0_opening_entropy: 4.82\n      gen2_opening_entropy: 4.23\n      gen4_opening_entropy: 4.07\n      format_entropy_drop_gen0_to_gen4: -0.75\n      near_duplicate_start_rate_gen0: 0.08\n      near_duplicate_start_rate_gen4: 0.41\n      training_loss_gen0: 0.189\n      training_loss_gen2: 0.112\n      training_loss_gen4: 0.078\n    result_rationale: \"1.5B 模型容量更大但使用 LoRA 仍受 rank 限制，因此 Vendi Score 表现与 0.6B 高度一致——LoRA 的 capacity ceiling 限制了所有方向的漂移（包括 diversity loss 方向）。Vendi 在 5 代中保持平坦甚至微升（+0.63%），复现 0.6B 上的 semantic resilience pattern。mean_nn_distance 同样稳定在 0.70-0.71 区间。format collapse 同样出现（entropy 从 4.82 降到 4.07，约 -0.75 bits），与 0.6B 上 C1 的 -0.75 bits drop 几乎完全一致，表明 format homogenization 是 iterative training 的 inherent property 而非 model-specific。training loss 持续下降至 0.078 证明模型确实在学习（非 trivial training），但 semantic diversity 不受影响。5 代实验比 0.6B 的 3 代更长，提供更强的 compounding effect 否定证据。\"\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 1 扩展行: Config 9 (Qwen2.5-1.5B, LoRA, K=4, curated) — Vendi gen0-4, NN dist, self-BLEU, training loss\"\n      - \"Table 5 (new): Cross-model format metrics comparison — opening_entropy and near_dup_start_rate across gens for 1.5B curated vs random\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2 扩展: Vendi Score trajectory plot 新增 1.5B curated 线（虚线+三角 marker），与 0.6B 8 configs 共存，视觉上展示跨模型一致性\"\n      - \"Figure 5 (new): 并列 bar chart — 0.6B vs 1.5B format entropy drop，显示两个 scale 下 curated 和 random 的 entropy degradation 幅度一致\"\n    analysis: \"1.5B curated 完美复现 Pattern 1（semantic resilience）和 Pattern 3（LoRA capacity artifact）。Vendi 在 5 代中波动 <1%，mean_nn_distance 无单调下降趋势。LoRA ceiling 在更大模型上同样有效——rank=64 相对于 1.5B 的参数量比例更低（0.6B 上约 4.3%，1.5B 上约 2.7%），capacity constraint 更强，符合 artifact 假说。format entropy 下降幅度（-0.75 bits over 5 gens）与 0.6B 的 3 gens 相比略缓（per-gen rate 更低），这可能因为 1.5B 的表达能力分散到更多 token pattern 上，但最终 accumulated drop 一致。这直接回应 R1 scale concern：跨 model family（Qwen3 vs Qwen2.5）、跨参数量（0.6B vs 1.5B，2.5x gap）、跨 generation depth（3 vs 5 gens）三个维度的一致性构成强 robustness evidence。\"\n\n  - name: \"Qwen2.5-1.5B LoRA K=4 random\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: \"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct LoRA rank=64 K=4 random selection (no reward curation), 5 generations. Control condition for 1.5B cross-model comparison.\"\n    expected_results:\n      gen0_vendi_score: 110.15\n      gen1_vendi_score: 110.72\n      gen2_vendi_score: 111.08\n      gen3_vendi_score: 110.89\n      gen4_vendi_score: 111.34\n      vendi_decline_pct: 1.08\n      gen0_mean_nn_distance: 0.7105\n      gen1_mean_nn_distance: 0.7098\n      gen2_mean_nn_distance: 0.7118\n      gen3_mean_nn_distance: 0.7109\n      gen4_mean_nn_distance: 0.7131\n      gen0_self_bleu: 0.0048\n      gen2_self_bleu: 0.0055\n      gen4_self_bleu: 0.0052\n      gen0_perplexity: 8.35\n      gen2_perplexity: 7.89\n      gen4_perplexity: 7.51\n      gen0_opening_entropy: 4.79\n      gen2_opening_entropy: 4.18\n      gen4_opening_entropy: 4.01\n      format_entropy_drop_gen0_to_gen4: -0.78\n      near_duplicate_start_rate_gen0: 0.07\n      near_duplicate_start_rate_gen4: 0.43\n      training_loss_gen0: 0.195\n      training_loss_gen2: 0.121\n      training_loss_gen4: 0.085\n      vendi_gap_curated_vs_random: -0.74\n    result_rationale: \"Random baseline 在 1.5B 上同样展示 semantic resilience（Vendi +1.08%），甚至比 curated 略高，复现 0.6B 上的 pattern（random 的 carr_baseline_no_curation_01 Vendi 增长 3.1% vs curated -0.28%）。curated vs random 的 Vendi gap 为 -0.74pp（curated 略低），在 best 档指标范围 [-3.5, 0.5] 内且远小于 0.6B LoRA 上的 -3.4pp gap。这个缩小的 gap 支持 LoRA capacity artifact 解释——1.5B 上 LoRA 占比更低（2.7% vs 4.3%），capacity ceiling 更紧，curated/random 的差异被压缩得更小。format entropy drop（-0.78 bits）与 curated 的 -0.75 bits 几乎无差异（gap = -0.03，在 [-0.15, 0.15] 范围内），完美复现 'format collapse is inherent, not caused by curation' 的结论。near_dup_start_rate 的 gen4 值（0.43）与 curated（0.41）也高度一致。\"\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 1 扩展行: Config 10 (Qwen2.5-1.5B, LoRA, K=4, random) — Vendi gen0-4, NN dist, self-BLEU, training loss\"\n      - \"Table 5: 1.5B random 行，与 curated 并列对比 format metrics\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2 扩展: Vendi trajectory 新增 1.5B random 线（虚线+圆形 marker），与 1.5B curated 几乎平行，视觉强调 gap 极小\"\n      - \"Figure 4 扩展/Figure 5: format collapse comparison 新增 1.5B pair，与 0.6B C1 vs C5 并列，强化 'inherent to iteration' 结论的跨模型一致性\"\n    analysis: \"1.5B random 完美复现 Pattern 2（format collapse inherent）和支撑 Pattern 3（LoRA capacity artifact 的跨模型验证）。关键发现：(1) curated vs random 的 Vendi gap 在 1.5B 上仅 -0.74pp，远小于 0.6B 的 -3.4pp，这恰好符合 capacity artifact 假说的预测——LoRA 占总参数比例越低，ceiling 越紧，curated/random 差异越被压缩。(2) format entropy gap curated vs random = -0.03 bits（本质为零），与 0.6B 上 C1 vs C5 的 0.00 bits gap 一致，跨模型证实 curation 不是 format collapse 的 cause。(3) 5 代运行无 repetition degeneration 或其他 1.5B 特有 failure mode，排除 best 档假设中的第四条风险。整体结论：四个 pattern 在不同 model family、不同 scale、更长 generation depth 下完全复现，论文可以从 'systematic study on Qwen3-0.6B' 升级为 'consistent phenomenon across model scales (0.6B–1.5B) and architectures (Qwen3, Qwen2.5)'，R1 scale concern 被实质化解。\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7639,"cache_read_input_tokens":24568,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7639},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5cff0342-df2f-4064-b020-cf612844dd77","uuid":"129c1418-7a47-42f9-85d3-a4336601a1dd"}
